{"type":"message","id":"464bb93f","parentId":"fc18626a","timestamp":"2026-01-30T21:31:36.291Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You are the PLANNER agent for the HHC Brooklyn Dental bid takeoff (Project #26202103).\n\n## Your Job\nCreate task packets for Demo items 8-23 (Existing Conditions / Demolition). These are the first batch in our multi-agent takeoff pipeline.\n\n## Bid Items to Plan (all quantities currently blank)\n- Item 8: Demo Interior Partitions | SF\n- Item 9: Demo Existing Built Up Floor Finishes - VCT, Adhesive, Base & Saddles | SF\n- Item 10: Demo Existing Ceiling Finishes - ACT & GWB | SF\n- Item 11: Remove and Reinstall Ceilings at Floor Below for MEP Work - Allow 10% for Replace Ceilings | SF\n- Item 12: Demo Single Doors | EA\n- Item 13: Demo Millwork | LF\n- Item 14: Create New Door Opening in Masonry Wall Inc Lintel | LOC\n- Item 15: Remove Ceramic Tile on Wall to Remain | SF\n- Item 16: Remove Concrete Pad | SF\n- Item 17: Remove Chair Rail | LF\n- Item 18: Remove Refrigerator | EA\n- Item 19: Remove Access Doors | EA\n- Item 20: Remove Wall Mtd Shelving | LF\n- Item 21: Remove Floor Slab Recessed Boxes | SF\n- Item 22: Remove Interior Glazing | EA\n- Item 23: Carting Fixtures | EA\n\n## Key Drawing Sheets\n- DM-100.00 (5th Floor Demolition Plan) = part3/page-10\n- DM-200.00 (5th Floor Demolition RCP) = part3/page-11\n- A-100.00 (5th Floor Construction Plan) = part3/page-12 (for reference of what's new vs existing)\n\n## Reference Files (read these)\n- /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-brooklyn-dental/room_schedule.json\n- /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-brooklyn-dental/door_schedule.json\n- /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-brooklyn-dental/scope_analysis.md (read the Demo section)\n- /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-brooklyn-dental/takeoff_checklist.md (read item 8-23 section)\n- /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-brooklyn-dental/specs_summary.json (look for section 024119 - Selective Demolition)\n\n## Drawing Images (analyze these for demo symbols, hatching, and keynotes)\n- /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-brooklyn-dental/sheets/part3/page-10.png (DM-100.00 Demo Plan)\n- /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-brooklyn-dental/sheets/part3/page-11.png (DM-200.00 Demo RCP)\n- /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-brooklyn-dental/sheets/part3/page-12.png (A-100.00 Construction Plan - reference)\n\n## Output\nWrite a JSON file to: /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-brooklyn-dental/task_packets_demo.json\n\nFormat:\n```json\n{\n  \"batch\": \"demo-items-8-23\",\n  \"created\": \"<timestamp>\",\n  \"planner_notes\": \"<overall notes about this batch>\",\n  \"task_packets\": [\n    {\n      \"item_number\": 8,\n      \"description\": \"Demo Interior Partitions\",\n      \"unit\": \"SF\",\n      \"sheets_needed\": [\"part3/page-10\"],\n      \"spec_sections\": [\"024119\"],\n      \"context_summary\": \"<what the executor needs to know>\",\n      \"measurement_approach\": \"<how to derive the quantity — be specific>\",\n      \"known_flags\": [],\n      \"depends_on\": [],\n      \"grouping\": \"<which items can be measured from the same sheet simultaneously>\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nBe specific in measurement_approach — tell the Executor exactly what to look for on each sheet, what symbols mean demo, and how to calculate the quantity. Group items that share sheets."},{"type":"image","data":"","mimeType":"image/jpeg"},{"type":"image","data":"","mimeType":"image/jpeg"},{"type":"image","data":"","mimeType":"image/jpeg"}],"timestamp":1769808696288}}
