{"type":"message","id":"2a33b6b6","parentId":"d9fa8880","timestamp":"2026-01-30T21:35:53.478Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Task complete.** Written `task_packets_demo.json` with 16 task packets for demo items 8-23.\n\n**Key findings:**\n- **DM-100.00 keynotes 1-39** map directly to most demo bid items. I documented which keynote(s) correspond to each bid item.\n- **Grouping:** Items 8, 12-22 all share DM-100.00 (Group A). Items 10-11 are ceiling-related from DM-200.00 (Group C). Item 9 is floor-area based (Group B). Item 23 is derived from all others.\n- **Approximate counts from image analysis:** ~18-20 demo doors, ~3 keynote 1 (masonry openings), ~4 keynote 9 (tile removal), ~2 keynote 35 (interior glazing), ~2 refrigerators, ~1 concrete pad.\n- **Flags:** Wall height needed for Item 8 SF calc; ACM risk in floor adhesives; Item 11 (4th floor R&R) is highest risk; Item 23 \"EA\" unit is ambiguous; keynote numbers had some reading inconsistencies due to image resolution — executor should verify."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":1,"output":291,"cacheRead":47031,"cacheWrite":7965,"totalTokens":55288,"cost":{"input":0.000005,"output":0.007275,"cacheRead":0.023515499999999998,"cacheWrite":0.04978125,"total":0.08057675}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1769808943876}}
